## RESEARCH ARTICLE
An efficient and robust metal-free allpH catalyst for hydrogen evolution reactions is realized by coupling inactive MOF-derived N-rich carbon (MHCF) with pure carbon nanotubes to induce combined intra-/intermolecular electron transfer in MHCF for synergistically optimizing $\Delta G_{H^{\star}}$ near zero, followed by rational surface modulation of carboxylgroup-rich polymers to afford the local proton enrichment at $p H=0$ and enhanced water adsorption and activation at $p H=7$ and 14.
